{"from": "N-000507", "type": "depends_on", "to": "AC-5.6", "provenance": "judgment", "judgment": "J-003147", "rationale": "AC-5.6 (layer V, MAY modality) describes how S6 contributes in specific cases sharing terms or keywords; N-000507 (layer L4, MUST modality) is a higher-level requirement that candidates must carry quantities of the same dimension when sharing a term or keyword. AC-5.6 presupposes the constraint established by N-000507.", "quotes": ["S6 contributes with dimension time and both values", "Both carry a quantity of the same dimension (time, size, count, percent), in claims sharing a term or a keyword"]}
